        "external.dualselect",
        {
          "cls": "dualselect.competitors.dbal.DBALStrategy"
        }
      ]
    },
    "note": "'main' is the 17-strategy panel of the paper. 'extras' holds the router (standalone V58, the only version shipped) and WALC as a fixed mode, so that the router can be compared fairly to all three modes it routes over. Extras are run by default so that the decision to report the router can be taken at analysis time without re-running. 'dualselect' runs the released DualSelect package (KBS 2026) through an adapter (src/alframework/bench/external.py): shared initial set, masked pool labels, exact batch size; hyper-parameters are those of the DualSelect paper (benchmarks/config.py of the dualselect repository). 'dbal_dualselect' is the DBAL implementation released with DualSelect (least-confidence uncertainty, unweighted k-means), run to reconcile the rankings of the two papers."
  },
